{"id":"c385ef3125110e6f","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-omega-rule-true-arithmetic.md","title":"Full Omega-Rule Closure Equals True Arithmetic","display":"thm-omega-rule-true-arithmetic — Full Omega-Rule Closure Equals True Arithmetic","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-omega-rule-true-arithmetic","aliases":["92-thm-omega-rule-true-arithmetic"],"display":"thm-omega-rule-true-arithmetic — Full Omega-Rule Closure Equals True Arithmetic","source":"第 X 章 p. 113（PDF 130）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-weak-g-system]]","[[92-df-true-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-standard-model]]","[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-omega-rule-true-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-omega-rule-true-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-rule-true-arithmetic — Full Omega-Rule Closure Equals True Arithmetic"},{"key":"source","html":"第 X 章 p. 113（PDF 130）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb22eb42bae0cef9\" href=\"?note=bb22eb42bae0cef9\" title=\"92-df-weak-g-system\">92-df-weak-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d782096c679079e3\" href=\"?note=d782096c679079e3\" title=\"92-df-true-arithmetic\">92-df-true-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 是本库固定 PA 呈现；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G^\\omega)\\)</span> 是<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bb22eb42bae0cef9\" href=\"?note=bb22eb42bae0cef9\" title=\"92-df-weak-g-system\">92-df-weak-g-system</a>定义的完整 ω 规则与有限后承的最小共同闭包。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TA}_G=\\{X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\mid\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(X)\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TA}_G=\\{X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\mid\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(X)\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}omega\\text{-}rule\\text{-}true\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Th}(G^\\omega)=\\mathrm{TA}_G.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}omega\\text{-}rule\\text{-}true\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Th}(G^\\omega)=\\mathrm{TA}_G.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>标准自然数满足 PA；有限一阶后承和完整 ω 规则都保真。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TA}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{TA}_G\\)</span> 是定义闭包时的一个候选，给出左侧包含于右侧。</p>\n<p>反向对公式的逻辑复杂度归纳，同时处理任意给全部自由变量赋自然数后形成的闭实例的真值与假值。闭原子等式及其否定由 PA 的数码计算、后继单射与非零后继公理判定。联结词步用经典逻辑；真存在句选一个数码见证，假全称句选一个反例；真全称句的全部数码实例在闭包内，故完整 ω 规则加入全称句。假存在句通过全部否定实例、ω 规则与量词对偶推出其否定。每步下降到更低复杂度，覆盖所有闭句。</p>\n<p>这是标准自然数真理的外部完备性。闭包允许无限前提和可能超限的证明树，不是一个证明码可判定的有限有效系统；没有与不完备性定理冲突。原书随后讨论的较弱可公理化 ω 规则不能套用此等式。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 X 章 p. 113（PDF 130）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-weak-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"bb22eb42bae0cef9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-weak-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-true-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"d782096c679079e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-true-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-standard-model","status":"resolved","id":"ccb738ae4bbf923c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-standard-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-truth","status":"resolved","id":"482ac6c3f68b4b5b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-weak-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"bb22eb42bae0cef9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ 是本库固定 PA 呈现；$\\mathrm{Th}(G^\\omega)$ 是[[92-df-weak-g-system]]定义的完整 ω 规则与有限后承的最小共同闭包。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(G^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TA}_G=\\{X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\mid\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(X)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}omega\\text{-}rule\\text{-}true\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Th}(G^\\omega)=\\mathrm{TA}_G.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TA}_G","display":false}],"bytes":2062,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-omega-rule]] → [[92-df-weak-g-system]] → [[92-thm-omega-rule-true-arithmetic]] → [[92-df-true-arithmetic]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-weak-g-system]]、[[92-thm-omega-rule-true-arithmetic]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-290","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-omega-rule-true-arithmetic]]"}],"outgoing":["bb22eb42bae0cef9","d782096c679079e3","e0eabee5d77258a7","ccb738ae4bbf923c","482ac6c3f68b4b5b"]}